--- !u!114 &817045505
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 817045501}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 41d0eed8772294ceea22cbebcb189407, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  nodes:
  - nodeID: start
    dialogueText: Hi Umi!
    choices: []
    nextNodeID: eloFlight
  - nodeID: eloFlight
    dialogueText: I slept through my WHOLE flight, they couldn't even wake me up
      to eat food. How are you doing, love?
    choices:
    - choiceText: I'm mostly alright, but I miss you already...
      targetNodeID: eloMiss
    - choiceText: I'm fine
      targetNodeID: eloSilly
    nextNodeID: 
  - nodeID: eloMiss
    dialogueText: Aw love... I miss you so much. I love that I can still see you
      even if you're just pixels on my screen now though.
    choices:
    - choiceText: Me too... Still, I'd rather see you for real.
      targetNodeID: eloTimeFly
    - choiceText: I wanna jump through my screen!!
      targetNodeID: eloCatch
    nextNodeID: 
  - nodeID: eloSilly
    dialogueText: You're so silly, you still think I'd buy that?
    choices:
    - choiceText: ...okay, I'm a little sad.
      targetNodeID: eloTimeFly
    - choiceText: I am though!
      targetNodeID: eloSure
    nextNodeID: 
  - nodeID: eloTimeFly
    dialogueText: Me too, love... me too. Time will fly by so fast though, you'll
      see!
    choices:
    - choiceText: It will.. I can't wait.
      targetNodeID: eloTryGame
    - choiceText: Maybe we could learn how to time travel?
      targetNodeID: eloLetsDoThat
    nextNodeID: 
  - nodeID: eloCatch
    dialogueText: Hahaha, then I'd catch you!
    choices:
    - choiceText: Alright, get ready then!!
      targetNodeID: eloAlwaysReady
    - choiceText: Promise to do that when we're back together?
      targetNodeID: eloPromise
    nextNodeID: 
  - nodeID: eloLetsDoThat
    dialogueText: Haha, let's do that. In the meantime, do you wanna do something
      together?
    choices:
    - choiceText: Yes!
      targetNodeID: eloTryGame
    - choiceText: Nahhh
      targetNodeID: eloVeryFunny
    nextNodeID: 
  - nodeID: eloTryGame
    dialogueText: Oh hey, let's try that drawing game we found! I'll start it up,
      wait for my invite!
    choices: []
    nextNodeID: 
  - nodeID: eloVeryFunny
    dialogueText: Veeery funny, too bad, we're gonna play a game!
    choices:
    - choiceText: Hahaha fine!
      targetNodeID: eloTryGame
    - choiceText: Alrighttt
      targetNodeID: eloTryGame
    nextNodeID: 
  - nodeID: eloAlwaysReady
    dialogueText: I'm always ready!!
    choices:
    - choiceText: I wish it really was that easy...
      targetNodeID: eloIKnow
    - choiceText: Hahaha, I believe you.
      targetNodeID: eloOfCourse
    nextNodeID: 
  - nodeID: eloPromise
    dialogueText: I promise, love. Do you wanna do something together right now?
    choices:
    - choiceText: Yes!
      targetNodeID: eloTryGame
    - choiceText: Nahhh
      targetNodeID: eloVeryFunny
    nextNodeID: 
  - nodeID: eloIKnow
    dialogueText: I know, me too... Hey, let's do something together!
    choices:
    - choiceText: Yes!
      targetNodeID: eloTryGame
    - choiceText: Nahhh
      targetNodeID: eloVeryFunny
    nextNodeID: eloTryGame
  - nodeID: eloOfCourse
    dialogueText: Of course, you know I've got your back! Hey, let's go do something
      right now!
    choices: []
    nextNodeID: eloTryGame
  - nodeID: eloSure
    dialogueText: Uh-huh sure, sure you are. Don't forget you can talk to me whenever,
      alright?
    choices:
    - choiceText: I know, love.. thank you.
      targetNodeID: eloTryGame
    - choiceText: I will.. let's talk about something else for now though
      targetNodeID: eloTryGame
    nextNodeID: 
